# UX States

Every list, detail, and builder panel must handle:

| State | Requirement |
|-------|-------------|
| Loading | Skeleton or spinner — reuse shared skeletons |
| Empty | `EmptyState` + clear next action |
| Error | `ErrorState` + retry when safe |
| Success | Toast or inline confirm for mutations |
| Partial | e.g. 3D failed but specs still show |

Do not ship pages that only handle the happy path. Checkout and payments: explicit failure + “do not pay twice” guidance when status is unknown.
